  "description": "LocalMind is a fast, private AI assistant that works 100% offline.\nChat, talk, and interact with powerful on-device LLMs — without sending your data to any server.\n\nWhether you want to ask questions, think through ideas, practice speaking, or use your device as a personal AI companion, LocalMind delivers instant responses fully on your device.\n\n\nWhy LocalMind?\n\t•\tOffline AI: All processing happens locally. No internet required after downloading models.\n\t•\tPrivate by design: Your chats, voice input, and data never leave your device.\n\t•\tVoice & Chat: Talk naturally or type — both modes are supported.\n\t•\tOn-device LLMs: Run popular local models such as Llama, Gemma, Phi, DeepSeek, Qwen, and more.\n\t•\tFast performance: Optimized with MLX and Apple Silicon for instant responses.\n\t•\tNo cloud servers: Zero tracking, zero analytics, zero data collection.\n\n\nKey Features\n\t•\tVoice input powered by on-device speech processing\n\t•\tSmart, natural chat responses\n\t•\tMultiple local models with different strengths\n\t•\tFull privacy with no accounts required\n\t•\tWorks completely offline\n\t•\tClean, modern UI optimized\n\n\nSubscription Required\n\nLocalMind offers a paid subscription that unlocks all premium features and future updates.\n\nAvailable Plans:\n\t•\tWeekly subscription\n\t•\tOne-time lifetime purchase\n\nPayment is charged to your Apple ID. Subscriptions renew automatically unless canceled in Settings at least 24 hours before renewal.\n\n\nYour Data Stays on Your Device\n\nLocalMind does not collect, store, or transmit your personal data.\nFor full details, review our policies below:\n\nTerms of Use:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1FQp-2FY3hpTVWpt1653uIf71rh7D3oip/view?usp=share_link\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1vg6-NbAlExUX2eOWQgCwnvqM6irty0JT/view?usp=share_link\n\n\nExperience the future of offline AI.\n\nPrivate, fast, and entirely on your device — exactly how AI should be.",
